1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,059
Poora din phone chalata hoon, par kamai zero.

2
00:00:03,359 --> 00:00:08,864
To phone chalana chhod, phone theek karna seekh! Mobile repair ki dukaan khol.

3
00:00:09,164 --> 00:00:11,921
Par mujhe to repair aata hi nahi, Chacha!

4
00:00:12,221 --> 00:00:16,783
Teen mahine ka course kar. Phir kisi dukaan pe chhe mahine kaam seekh.

5
00:00:17,083 --> 00:00:21,950
Phir 60 hazaar mein tools, soldering machine aur thoda spare stock.

6
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:26,518
Beta, mere phone ki screen toot gayi. Pote ne phenk diya!

7
00:00:26,818 --> 00:00:30,069
Ek ghante mein nayi screen, uncle. 2 hazaar rupaye.

8
00:00:30,369 --> 00:00:35,785
Har screen pe 800 tak ka munafa. Roz ke 2-3 hazaar aaram se.

9
00:00:36,085 --> 00:00:41,456
Aur cover, charger, tempered glass bech. 20 ka glass, 150 mein bikta hai!

10
00:00:41,756 --> 00:00:45,463
Sonu Mobile Wala, ab sheher mein number one! Life set!
